flowchart TB
accTitle: Engine conversion and data replication converge
accDescr: SQL Server schema is converted and validated separately from full-load and ongoing row changes before the MySQL target is used.
SQL[SQL Server Always On]:::inputData
SQL -->|schema and code| SCT[SCT assessment and conversion]
SCT --> FIX[Resolve findings and test]
FIX --> MYSQL[RDS for MySQL target]:::storage
SQL -->|rows and transaction changes| DMS[DMS full load + CDC]
DMS --> MYSQL
MYSQL --> GATE{Caught up and reconciled?}:::decision
GATE -->|yes, source writes stopped| APP[Switch application]:::output
GATE -->|no| HOLD[Continue migration]:::warning
